{"data": [{"author_id": "1932253875295412224", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:26:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118500240949235872"], "id": "2118500240949235872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 9, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "@GeminiApp 省流：更长（15s，而且可以精确指定时长）、更便宜（720p 每秒 0.07 美元）、更好用（组合使用不同图片，最长 3 秒的片段以及音频来引导生成。一致性更好了）。\n\n开发者：可以在 Google AI Studio 中测试原型，并用 Gemini API 。\n\n企业用户：Google Cloud 控制台和 API 构建。\n\n普通人：Google Vids", "url": "https://x.com/Sunshyyz/status/2118500240949235872"}, {"author_id": "59455659", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:19:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118498527768719533"], "id": "2118498527768719533", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Is this on Flow as well?", "url": "https://x.com/redrum0171/status/2118498527768719533"}, {"author_id": "866148566", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-06T00:16:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118497663029227872"], "id": "2118497663029227872", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Omni 1.2 Flash is rolling to all Google AI subscribers in the Gemini app, with Ultra users getting create-and-edit up to 15 seconds. Consumer Ultra length is the upsell; the API already advertised the same 15-second ceiling to developers.", "url": "https://x.com/nxtday/status/2118497663029227872"}, {"author_id": "1715828508591607808", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:55:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118492313425187148"], "id": "2118492313425187148", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Does it know how to troubleshoot without having to keep trying over and over until it decides the best thing to do is restore to default? Huh, does it?", "url": "https://x.com/WizardOfOwls/status/2118492313425187148"}, {"author_id": "1225686973802659846", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T23:09:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118480793957965924"], "id": "2118480793957965924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Multi-turn video edits are the real unlock. One-shot generation was a demo; conversational refine is how people actually ship clips.", "url": "https://x.com/jc38157498/status/2118480793957965924"}, {"author_id": "1881173355921108992", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:32:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118471551637221380"], "id": "2118471551637221380", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp I have burned real money rendering full-res clips I threw away five minutes later, so drafting at $0.07 a second and upscaling only the winners changes how many ideas I can afford to test. Multi-turn edits on top of that would keep a video project inside the Gemini app. My test", "url": "https://x.com/harden_369741/status/2118471551637221380"}, {"author_id": "1517641020846096387", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:16:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118467478158524764"], "id": "2118467478158524764", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 44, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Detalhe útil: o Omni 1.2 Flash sobe o vídeo nativo de 10s da versão 1.1 para 15s, com edição em várias rodadas sem regenerar o clipe inteiro. O preço de 720p caiu 30%, para US$ 0,07 por segundo, segundo o blog do Google.", "url": "https://x.com/HenriqueMachado/status/2118467478158524764"}, {"author_id": "1405686061460774914", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T22:10:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118466096647074000"], "id": "2118466096647074000", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 63, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Plus, Google AI Ultra subscribers can now create and edit videos up to 15 seconds long, giving you more room to tell complete stories, create product explainers, or produce full social ad spots in a single generation. ✔️", "url": "https://x.com/Joseph37017371/status/2118466096647074000"}, {"author_id": "870951755965661184", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:51:33.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118461242100846635"], "id": "2118461242100846635", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Giving more people the ability to bring their game ideas to life is what makes tools like this exciting.", "url": "https://x.com/Nely_Brooks/status/2118461242100846635"}, {"author_id": "1894307536406548483", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:35:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118457078171963817"], "id": "2118457078171963817", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 42, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp That sounds pretty neat! Looking forward to trying out these new Gemini features.", "url": "https://x.com/AbirOnAI/status/2118457078171963817"}, {"author_id": "833024146414125057", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T21:29:11.000Z", "edi