n be used without major issues... you are the worst company in existance i would love to see gemini app code and hang anyone who made this absurdity", "url": "https://x.com/TheCodeViber/status/2118444611412570272"}, {"author_id": "860198749607534592", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T20:41:05.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118443506457079969"], "id": "2118443506457079969", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp \"the ability to edit instead of regenerate is the real upgrade. that's what makes AI video actually usable.\"", "url": "https://x.com/Noah_SV93/status/2118443506457079969"}, {"author_id": "3297681537", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:45:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118429452451315719"], "id": "2118429452451315719", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Where is this happening?", "url": "https://x.com/techgoalz/status/2118429452451315719"}, {"author_id": "746849706622353408", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:37:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118427597583364382"], "id": "2118427597583364382", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Soon.", "url": "https://x.com/IDLESFan2000/status/2118427597583364382"}, {"author_id": "746849706622353408", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:37:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118427509842952237"], "id": "2118427509842952237", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 389, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Maybe you should start rolling out Omni Pro.", "url": "https://x.com/IDLESFan2000/status/2118427509842952237"}, {"author_id": "2102318912625094656", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:31:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118426076364120339"], "id": "2118426076364120339", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Multi-turn edits usually struggle with latent drift between passes. Curious if this relies on localized cross-attention masking or full latent re-encoding across turns.", "url": "https://x.com/JohnKocdr/status/2118426076364120339"}, {"author_id": "1160064457546113026", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:23:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118424072971284649"], "id": "2118424072971284649", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 78, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp Multi-turn video edits at this price is the part that actually changes creator workflows. How long before 15 seconds feels short?", "url": "https://x.com/uiNerd/status/2118424072971284649"}, {"author_id": "1838558231590830080", "conversation_id": "2118406227533435391", "created_at": "2026-11-05T19:23:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118423950849880401"], "id": "2118423950849880401", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "@GeminiApp 15-second Omni clips plus conversational edits is the upgrade creators needed. Curious what breaks first at that length: character consistency or audio sync?", "url": "https://x.com/Righteousbeing7/status/2118423950849880401"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "1932253875295412224", "name": "杨老师玩AI", "username": "Sunshyyz"}, {"id": "59455659", "name": "Redrum__Gaming 🎮", "username": "redrum0171"}, {"id": "866148